{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Demo Version now available!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The demo includes content from Day 1 and Day 2.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everyone can experience the flow, overall atmosphere, and story tone! (\uff1e\u4eba\uff1c;)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even though we're close to release and working on finalizing the main game (so major framework changes might be difficult), we will definitely fix any bugs with full effort! If you find any bugs, please send them to our email: <a href=\"mailto:1937396015@qq.com\">1937396015@qq.com</a></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you're interested after playing, please consider adding it to your wishlist! Thank you so much! For a small, unknown indie game like ours, this is <i>really</i>\u2014incredibly important! Every single &quot;+1&quot; from everyone is the motivation that keeps us going!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Trapped for 7 Days with a Yandere Girl? Yandere Heroine \u00d7 Anime Style  GAL Game!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3946810/extras/e5958a8322eae055eea301db421dc335.poster.avif?t=1772715398\" width=1600 height=87 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3946810/extras/e5958a8322eae055eea301db421dc335.webm?t=1772715398\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Awakening with lost memories,you found myself imprisoned in an unfamiliar room.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>And before you appeared\u2014a peculiar girl.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>She declared you her most important person, insisting this room was your sanctuary.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This is a tale of a hollow amnesiac and a cage-weaving enigmatic girl\u2014fates forever entwined.</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3946810/extras/a42c37ddfe82fbda53c248f4ce5fe6db.avif?t=1772715398\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3946810/extras_big/a42c37ddfe82fbda53c248f4ce5fe6db.webp?t=1772715398 width=1600 height=900 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3946810/extras/2fd9f107f11b6bb90fa1c53bdf2a6255.avif?t=1772715398\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3946810/extras_big/2fd9f107f11b6bb90fa1c53bdf2a6255.webp?t=1772715398 width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3946810/extras/e39e16ee0b7bfcb0e3ab30f6069889b5.poster.avif?t=1772715398\" width=1600 height=87 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3946810/extras/e39e16ee0b7bfcb0e3ab30f6069889b5.webm?t=1772715398\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2740 <strong>Shiro</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A deceptively serene, pink-haired girl in white.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She mutters to herself, spirals into despair, then erupts into madness... Her emotions shift at terrifying speed, her psyche ever-unstable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One misstep will trigger her rage...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yet sometimes, sadness surfaces\u2014for you, her most precious one, lost your memories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She chains you with &quot;protection&quot; and honeyed words, sealing every exit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>What happened beyond these walls? What secrets does she hide?</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3946810/extras/d572b7819ebba6b5194728c5c35e3398.poster.avif?t=1772715398\" width=1600 height=980 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3946810/extras/d572b7819ebba6b5194728c5c35e3398.webm?t=1772715398\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3946810/extras/d572b7819ebba6b5194728c5c35e3398.mp4?t=1772715398\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3946810/extras/bd340d051f17012f2487e66187a71070.poster.avif?t=1772715398\" width=890 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3946810/extras/bd340d051f17012f2487e66187a71070.webm?t=1772715398\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3946810/extras/bd340d051f17012f2487e66187a71070.mp4?t=1772715398\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3946810/extras/bc45da3e51c9dfbc182dd536a1e7a5ee.poster.avif?t=1772715398\" width=914 height=550 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3946810/extras/bc45da3e51c9dfbc182dd536a1e7a5ee.webm?t=1772715398\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3946810/extras/bc45da3e51c9dfbc182dd536a1e7a5ee.mp4?t=1772715398\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;Stay here... Stay with Shiro forever and ever and ever and ever and ever and ever and ever.&quot;</i><br><i>&quot;Why must you always leave me...?&quot;</i><br><i>&quot;...Tell me how to bring back your smile\u2014the one you once gave only to me.&quot;</i><br><i>&quot;Isn't this world, just for us two... pure bliss?&quot;</i><br> <br><i>&quot;Watch only me... always...&quot; </i><br><i>&quot;Or this loneliness... will consume us both.&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3946810/extras/86d54e3aeecad3bee7e9441d5526b4b6.poster.avif?t=1772715398\" width=1600 height=87 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3946810/extras/86d54e3aeecad3bee7e9441d5526b4b6.webm?t=1772715398\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2740 Classic anime-inspired story! Make choices based on your preferences to advance the plot.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2740 Immersive environment! Features three time phases - Daytime, Dusk, and Night - that change and progress over time.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2740 Fully animated character art! This short visual novel comes with fully animated character sprites.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spend seven days in this small room with Shiro. Observe her. Survive to the end\u2014</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >GAME TAGS | <i>kanojo,yandere,seven days,7days,girlfriend,purelove,Love,lovestory,koi,visual novel,gal,galgame,avg,anime,hentai,lsp,uniform,loli,</i>prison</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3946810?t=1772715398","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3946810/f02720623eeb70d6793511d9d4e0387f3bd674fa/page